Happy Friday Broadcasters!

Here’s another patch of fixes for Episode Two. We'd like to say a quick thanks to everyone who’s contacted us so far and helped out, and of course rest assured we are still working on more fixes as we go.

The response to Episode Two has been truly overwhelming and we’re so grateful for your kind words and your support.

Now, about those pesky bugs...

Patch Notes

Interference

Level 1 Interference Tutorial updated for clarity;
Fixed Interference Sensitivity option not saving;
Fixed Interference hotkey not working properly.;
Interference wave construction optimized;
Interference control responsiveness improved.


Graphics

Fixed game not rendering correctly on non- 16:9 displays.


Localisation

Fixed Episode 2 adverts sometimes showing English subtitles in other languages;
Russian Episode 2 advert subtitles updated;
Fixed player getting an E grade for sequence three of a broadcast if they reached 100% audience by the end of sequence two;
Fixed incorrect audio playing in Episode 3 teaser in Extras menu.


Until next time, from all of us here at NotGames, have a peaceful night.
